The prime gap bound hierarchy:
\begin{array}{lll}
\text{TPC} &\Rightarrow& H \leq 2 \text{ (open)}\\
\text{unconditional} & \Rightarrow & H \leq 246 \text{ (tight)}
\end{array}

where $H = \liminf_{n\to\infty}(p_{n+1} - p_n)$ and the 246 bound is optimal for the Maynard-Tao 50-tuple sieve.
